Cell["Checks", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"ef493c8a-752f-48ed-80dc-a0b2f3f3363a"],

Cell["\<\
1) The sectors sum back to the PNpedia spinning file (expect 0 for every \
mode). 2) hNS equals the spinning file at s = \[Sigma] = 0 (expect True). 3) \
Eq. (6.17) through 3.5PN equals hNS[2, 2] (expect 0).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c9452e85-0370-4438-8967-b87da2576f6b"],

